on is an excessive libido. She's not only aware of going into heat, she enjoys it. Once this \"switch\" in her is activated, she goes from carefree to sexy in an instant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"description from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3044"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"診療所の一番古い患者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも寝ぼけているようなスローライフなペルシャ猫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本を読んでいたりすることも多く、意外な才女？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病状は性欲過多。発情期の自覚は完全にある（楽しんでいる）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度スイッチが入ると、いつもののんびりさは色気にシフトする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テクニシャン。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25942","sourceWorkId":"6918","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"診療所の一番古い患者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも寝ぼけているようなスローライフなペルシャ猫。本を読んでいたりすることも多く、意外な才女？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病状は性欲過多。発情期の自覚は完全にある（楽しんでいる）。一度スイッチが入ると、いつもののんびりさは、色気にシフトする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27159"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8834a3b3d2aa490f05956c872f9e7cfba71f0a758f48073e27e1917493f07b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23c063c187de7c86402301ad684ac60feff88ede05df8b3ad4b88b89bb20ee69.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"すずきけいこ","creatorId":"vndb:s445","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s445","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s445","name":"すずき けいこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24997:27159:6275:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3045","characterName":"ウミ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3045"},"originalCharacterName":"ウミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false